  "type": "singleCorrect",
  "level": 3,
  "question": {
    "text": "The space inside a straight current carrying solenoid is filled with a magnetic material having magnetic susceptibility equal to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></math>. What is fractional increase in the magnetic field inside solenoid with respect to air as medium inside the solenoid?",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "eOJin",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow></msup></math>",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "uYltQ",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math>",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "LaSRQ",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math>",
